  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "How to reproduce:\n\n1. Add the following objects at the same position in an avatar.\n    - `Sender`: has VRCContactSender with custom collision tag `Test`\n    - `Receiver`: has VRCContactReceiver with custom collision tag `Test` and writes constants to the parameter `TestParam`.\n2. Upload it and change the avatar into it.\n3. Rejoin the current instance or go to the new instance.\n4. Check the value of `TestParam` via avatar debug console.\n\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nAlways parameter `TestParam` equals `True`.\n\n\nActual behavior:\n\nOftenly `TestParam` indicates `False`.\nResetting or reloading avatars may fix this problem temporarily until you rejoin or move to some instance.\n\nEnvironment:\n\n- VRChat Build 1207\n- VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2022.06.03.00.04_Public\n- World: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_92f472fd-eb62-43a0-98ee-caf56d4935d6",
